{"headword":"מוֹצָא","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:3\" href=\"/Hosea.6.3\">Ho 6:3</a></sup> <strong>place</strong> or <strong>act of going forth, issue, export, source, spring</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 28:1\" href=\"/Job.28.1\">Jb 28:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:7\" href=\"/Psalms.75.7\">ψ 75:7</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:13\" href=\"/Numbers.30.13\">Nu 30:13</a> + 9 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹצָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:27\" href=\"/Job.38.27\">Jb 38:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:25\" href=\"/Daniel.9.25\">Dn 9:25</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֲךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.25\">2 S 3:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹצָאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:3\" href=\"/Hosea.6.3\">Ho 6:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:7\" href=\"/Psalms.19.7\">ψ 19:7</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41:18</a> + 5 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.11\">Ez 43:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:2\" href=\"/Numbers.33.2\">Nu 33:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.11\">Ez 42:11</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>a going forth:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"the act, of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:3\" href=\"/Hosea.6.3\">Ho 6:3</a>; of the sun = <em>rising</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:7\" href=\"/Psalms.19.7\">ψ 19:7</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָצָא\" href=\"/BDB,_יָצָא\", dir=\"rtl\">יצא</a> <strong>1 f</strong>); of a man <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.25\">2 S 3:25</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָבוֹא</span> Kt); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ דָּבָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:25\" href=\"/Daniel.9.25\">Dn 9:25</a> <em>going forth of a command</em>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"concrete, <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵי גּוֹלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.4\">Ez 12:4</a> <em>goings forth of</em> exile, i.e. <em>those going forth into</em> exile (in sim.)."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>way out, exit:</em> concrete, of chambers in temple <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.11\">Ez 42:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.11\">43:11</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹבָאָיו</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵי הַמִּקְדָּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.5\">Ez 44:5</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְבוֹא הַבַּיִת</span>)."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>that which goes forth:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>utterance</em> of mouth or lips (especially of solemn or formal speech), <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָא פִי־י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.3\">Dt 8:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שְׂפָתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.16\">Je 17:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:35\" href=\"/Psalms.89.35\">ψ 89:35</a>; so <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.24\">Dt 23:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 30:13\" href=\"/Numbers.30.13\">Nu 30:13</a> (P)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>export</em> of horses <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.28\">1 K 10:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 1:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.1.16\">2 Ch 1:16</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>place of going forth:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>source</em> or <em>spring</em> of water <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.21\">2 K 2:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.11\">Is 58:11</a> (in sim.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:33\" href=\"/Psalms.107.33\">ψ 107:33</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נְהָרוֹת</span>) v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:35\" href=\"/Psalms.107.35\">35</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַם־מים</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41:18</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָא מֵימֵי גִיחוֹן הָעֶלְיוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:30\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.30\">2 Ch 32:30</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>place of departure</em> of Israel on march <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:2\" href=\"/Numbers.33.2\">Nu 33:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (P)."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָא</span> = <em>east</em> (place of sun’s going forth) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:7\" href=\"/Psalms.75.7\">ψ 75:7</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲרָב</span>); zeugmatically, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:9\" href=\"/Psalms.65.9\">65:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָאֵי בֹּקֶר וָעֶרֶב</span> i.e. <em>the east and the west</em> (cf. <em>the two Orients</em>, Qor 43:37)."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"place whence silver comes = <em>mine</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 28:1\" href=\"/Job.28.1\">Jb 28:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וּלְהַצְמִיחַ מֹצָא דֶשֶׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:27\" href=\"/Job.38.27\">38:27</a> and to cause the <em>growing-place</em> (others, <em>the growth</em>) of young grass to sprout."}],"num":"d."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB04101","strong_numbers":["4161","4162"],"next_hw":"מוֹצָא²","prev_hw":"צֶאֱצָא","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","quotes":[],"GK":["4604","4605"],"TWOT":["893c"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}